  quizId: c2_qz_p4
  tag: 0
  question: "C\u1EA3nh n\xE0o sau \u0111\xE2y c\xF3 trong hoa v\u0103n tr\u1ED1ng
    \u0111\u1ED3ng \u0110\xF4ng S\u01A1n?"
  options:
  - "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi gi\xE3 g\u1EA1o"
  - "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111i xe \u0111\u1EA1p"
  - "M\xE1y bay"
  - "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i b\xF3ng \u0111\xE1"
  correctIndex: 0
  explanation: "Hoa v\u0103n tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng c\xF3 c\u1EA3nh gi\xE3 g\u1EA1o,
    thuy\u1EC1n v\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xF3a trang l\xF4ng chim."
  relatedLore: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 02943b359c7116847b22c2ad99aaf046, type: 2}
  sourceRef: "SGK L\u1ECBch s\u1EED v\xE0 \u0110\u1ECBa l\xED 6 (ph\u1EA7n V\u0103n
    Lang \u2013 \xC2u L\u1EA1c); B\u1EA3o t\xE0ng L\u1ECBch s\u1EED Qu\u1ED1c gia:
    tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng Ng\u1ECDc L\u0169, v\u0103n h\xF3a \u0110\xF4ng S\u01A1n."
  verified: 1
